# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Repository-root ignores. `agent-workspace/` has its own .gitignore for the
# markdown office; this file covers the Orion codebase and everything the
# assistant writes at runtime.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Secrets. The real rule is AGENT.md §5 and CLAUDE.md §10: never write a
# credential to a file here. This is a safety net, not permission to try.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# Orion's runtime state — memory, notices, schedule, audit log, kill switch.
# Plain text and hand-editable by design, but it is Karl's data, not source.
orion/state/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# Recorded audio — push-to-talk scratch files never belong in git.
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Toolkit venvs — installed skill READMEs bootstrap `.qcvenv` next to the scripts.
.qcvenv/

# ORION.app build output — orion/macos/build.sh builds in-tree.
orion/macos/ORION.app/
orion/macos/orion.iconset/

# install.py displaces each previous skill install into .claude/skills-archive/<ts>/
# (repo-and-branches.md "Housekeeping": untracked, recoverable from canonical, noise).
# Ignore future snapshots; keep the one tracked pre-AI-OS snapshot as evidence.
.claude/skills-archive/*
!.claude/skills-archive/20260901T214812Z/

# VERIFY.md §8 test project — a nested git repo inside this checkout.
/scratch-site/
